/**
 * @mainpage LOCUS — Loader Of Compiled Universal Systems
 *
 * LOCUS (Loader Of Compiled Universal Systems) is an educational and
 * research-oriented userspace ELF loader for Linux.
 *
 * The project focuses on:
 * - Understanding how Linux loads ELF binaries
 * - Manual userspace ELF loading and validation
 * - ABI behavior across architectures
 * - Defensive handling of malformed ELF files
 *
 * @section locus_navigation Navigation
 * - @ref elf_image.h "ELF Image Abstraction"
 * - @ref elf_ident.h "ELF Identification"
 * - @ref elf_read.h  "Endian-aware ELF Reads"
 * - @ref locus_tests "Unit Tests"
 *
 * @section locus_groups Module Groups
 * - @ref locus
 *
 * @defgroup locus LOCUS ELF Loader
 * @brief Project-wide documentation group.
 */

